==Bavarian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|bar|schoaf}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|bar|gmh|scharpf}}, from {{inh|bar|goh|scarf}}, from {{inh|bar|gmw-pro|*skarp}}, from {{inh|bar|gem-pro|*skarpaz}}, from {{der|bar|ine-pro|*(s)kerb-}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*(s)ker-||to cut}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|bar|adjective}}

# [[sharp]]
#: {{ux|bar|a scharfs Messa|a sharp knife|inline=1}}
# [[keen]]
#: {{ux|bar|Madl, i bin scharf auf di!|Girl, I am keen on you!|inline=1}}

